[
  {
    "id": "first_desk",
    "title": "第一章 · 向いている場所",
    "day": 1,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "事務所を開ける最初の朝ですね。まずは、依頼を一枚受け付けるところから始めましょう。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "paper"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "剣の稽古は三年続けました。でも、あの日に借りた弓は、不思議なくらい手になじんで……。これを仕事にしても、いいんでしょうか。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "center"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "一度やってみてから決めよう。合わなければ戻せる。剣の三年まで、捨てる必要はないよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "薬草採取なら、私も行きます。道を見つける人と、草を見分ける人。二人でできる仕事ですね。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right",
            "motion": "nod",
            "motionAt": "私も行きます"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "まず『冒険者』でアルドの職業を狩人に変えましょう。そのあと『派遣』で薬草採取を選んでください。登録の変更に費用はかかりません。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "first_return",
    "title": "第一章 · おかえりの仕事",
    "day": 2,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "依頼の報告を受けるときは、成否と、全員が戻れたかを別々に確かめましょう。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "door"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "剣を振っていたころは、足元ばかり気にしていました。今は、遠くを見る練習もしています。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "薬草の数だけでなく、みんなの顔色も見てあげてください。疲れがたまっている人は、次の派遣を休ませることもできます。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "報告書の最後に『帰還確認』の欄を作ろう。依頼の成否だけでは、帰ってきた人を記録できない。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "報告書に必要な欄を、もう見つけたんですね……！",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "（たった今、思いついたんだけど……まあいいか。）",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "policy",
    "title": "第二章 · 引き返すための約束",
    "day": 3,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "腕が立つ奴ほど、引く理由がいるんだ。『ここまでやれ』だけじゃ、戻る判断ができん。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "paper"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "僕が『引き返そう』と言ったら、臆病だと思われませんか。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "戻ってこられれば、明日の依頼にもつながる。出発前に、どこで引き返すか決めておこう。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "回復薬も持っていけるんですね。私一人で、みんなを治そうとしなくていいんだ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "これで『方針』と『回復薬』を出発前に選べます。安全重視なら早めに引き返し、強気なら深く進みます。隊長の性格も判断に影響します。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "recruit",
    "title": "第二章 · 空いている椅子",
    "day": 4,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "リナ",
        "text": "外に人が並んでる。『才能を見抜く先生に会いたい』って。面接料、とっていい？",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "door"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "とらない。働いてくれる人を探しているんだから。それに、席を全部埋める必要もないよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right",
            "motion": "shake",
            "motionAt": "とらない"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "給料は、出発しない日にも要る。待ってもらう余裕まで考えるのが、雇い主の腕のうちだ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "募集の受付を始められます。契約金は日給の四日分。適性だけでなく、給与と今の仲間に足りない役割も見て選んでください。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "リナ",
        "text": "じゃあ、椅子はひとつ空けておく。……帰ってくる誰かの分、ってことにしようよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "facilities",
    "title": "第二章 · 帰る場所を直す",
    "day": 5,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "薬草と包帯の棚を整えたら、依頼書を置く場所がなくなってしまいました。ごめんなさい。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left",
            "motion": "nod",
            "motionAt": "ごめんなさい"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "step"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "謝らなくていい。仕事の場所を先に作らなかった。僕の準備不足だよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "治療所か、訓練所か、宿舎か。どれも一度には建てられん。今の仲間に何が必要か、見て決めよう。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "施設の計画を立てられます。負傷に備えるなら治療所、成長を助けるなら訓練所、仲間を迎えるなら宿舎です。強化費を払ったあとも、日給を残しておきましょう。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "これなら薬草と道具の置き場所も整えられます。次の準備が、少し楽になりますね。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "charter",
    "title": "第三章 · 灰の便り",
    "day": 6,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "鉱山から、灰の混じった水の知らせが届きました。遺跡に棲む灰竜が、地下水路を塞いでいるそうです。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "paper"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "リナ",
        "text": "孤児院の井戸も濁ってた。お金があっても、いつまでも水を買い続けるわけにはいかないよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "正面から竜へ行くな。森で経験を積み、坑道で道を確かめてから、遺跡へ進め。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "街を救えなんて言われると大きすぎる。でも、今日の水を守る仕事なら、一つずつ考えられる。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミレイ",
        "text": "研修期間はここまでです。評判が上がれば、坑道と遺跡の依頼も受けられます。三十日目の市の査定までに灰竜討伐を目指しましょう。間に合わなくても、活動は続けられます。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mirei",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "aldo_trust",
    "title": "仲間の章 · 矢を放つ前に",
    "day": 8,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "向いていると言ってもらえたぶん、外すのが怖くなりました。才能があるのに、失敗したらどうしようって。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "step"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "適性は成功の約束じゃない。君が続けたい場所を探すための、ひとつの手がかりだよ。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "では、外した日の報告書も残します。次にどこを狙うか、考え直せるから。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left",
            "motion": "nod",
            "motionAt": "報告書も残します"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ミナ",
        "text": "剣の三年も、無駄じゃなかったね。前に立つ怖さを知っている弓使いだもの。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "mina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "mine",
    "title": "第三章 · 地図にない道",
    "day": 6,
    "area": "mine",
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "リナ",
        "text": "坑道の記録、線が一本足りない。昔、逃げるときに通った水路がある。……昔のことは、聞かないで。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "paper"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "聞かん。誰かを帰すために使える道なら、それでいい。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right",
            "motion": "nod",
            "motionAt": "それでいい"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "{name}",
        "text": "地図に書いてくれる？ 最短の道じゃなくて、安全な道を。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "リナ",
        "text": "あたし、帰り道はよく間違えるんだ。だから、目印はみんなで決めて。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "yuto",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "赤い布にしよう。俺の古いマントを切って使え。道を覚えるのは、一人の仕事じゃない。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "right"
          },
          {
            "character": "lina",
            "pose": "happy",
            "position": "left"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "cut"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "bruno",
    "title": "仲間の章 · 先頭の隣",
    "day": 12,
    "art": "guild-dawn",
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "ブルーノ",
        "text": "昔は、誰より前に立つのが俺の仕事だった。膝が痛むと、置いていかれたような気になる。",
        "background": "guild",
        "cast": [
          {
            "character": "bruno",
            "pose": "thoughtful",
            "position": "left"
          },
          {
            "character": "aldo",
            "pose": "neutral",
            "position": "right"
          }
        ],
        "transition": "fade",
        "sfx": "step"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "アルド",
        "text": "隣で歩いてくれませんか。前に出るべき瞬間を、まだ僕は見極められないんです。",
